        <h1>How to Build a Sampled Instrument in Ableton Live</h1>

        <p class="lede">
          Recording a viola across three dynamic layers, trimming and looping the
          sustains, and mapping the result into Sampler — including the two points
          where round-robin stopped behaving and what fixed it.
        </p>

        <dl class="byline">
          <div><dt>Written by</dt><dd class="byline__v">Auspicious Music editorial</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Published</dt><dd class="byline__v"><time datetime="2026-08-04">4 August 2026</time></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Last updated</dt><dd class="byline__v"><time datetime="2026-08-04">4 August 2026</time></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Reading time</dt><dd class="byline__v">22 min</dd></div>
        </dl>

