            <div><dt>Interface</dt><dd>2-in audio interface, 48 kHz / 24-bit</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Microphones</dt><dd>One large-diaphragm condenser, one small-diaphragm pair</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Source</dt><dd>Viola, three dynamic layers, chromatic every minor third</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Time needed</dt><dd>One recording session plus roughly three hours of editing</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </section>
